   "source": [
    "'''\n",
    "Clustering\n",
    "--------------------\n",
    "Unsupervised Learning\n",
    "- It does not have target value.\n",
    "- sillihoute score -> accuracy of clustering\n",
    "    -> how well clusters will be formed\n",
    "    -> -1 to 1\n",
    "    -> less than zero -> Bad Cluster\n",
    "    -> zero to 0.5 -> average cluster\n",
    "    -> 0.5 to 0.7 -> good cluster\n",
    "    -> 0.7 to 1 or near 1 -> best cluster\n",
    "\n",
    "Algorithm\n",
    "--------------------\n",
    "1. K-Means Clustering\n",
    "2. Agglomerative Clustering\n",
    "3. Hierarchical Clustering\n",
    "\n",
    "Dimensity Reduction Algorithm\n",
    "-----------------------------\n",
    "PCA -> Principle Component Analysis\n",
    "'''"
   ]
  }
